-- 80 load-test properties for Skyline (pagination, filters, admin lists, location stats).
-- Generated by a seeded script, so re-generating gives the same rows. Safe to re-run: existing ids are skipped.
-- Every id starts with "load-" so the set can be removed in one go (see the bottom of this file).
-- Codes come from the same sequences the app uses, so they never clash with real property codes.

BEGIN;

ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

COMMIT;

-- Remove the load-test data again (leads first: they reference properties):
